| `kappa_on`         | Slip at which the request starts to fall; assumed, between the working slip and the peak                         | --  |   0.036 |
| `kappa_off`         | Slip at which the request reaches zero; the tire's adhesion peak, sAdhesion                         | --  |   0.04 |

